# Docker build context for any image built from the repo root (the pnpm workspace is needed).
# Keep the context tiny — a context-ROOT .dockerignore is the reliable mechanism (BuildKit's
# per-Dockerfile `<name>.dockerignore` is NOT honored across versions).
**/node_modules
.git
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/out
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.build
release
*.log
.DS_Store
# heavy asset trees not needed to build
.claude
**/public/tesseract
